skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title Monorepo — quote consumption before inference and separate ledger
start
:Chat/completion/embedding endpoint calls quote gate;
if (Gate denied?) then (yes)
 :Return payment-required response;
 stop
endif
if (Gate supplies quote?) then (yes)
 :Upsert supplied quote with consumed=true and status=consumed;
 :Insert billing usage record in separate store call;
endif
:Continue inference endpoint work;
note right
 Consumption and usage write precede inference.
 A later inference failure does not trigger a refund here.
 Failure after quote update can leave no usage record.
end note
stop
footer
Source-reviewed orchestration. Nested semantics remain open; no runtime acceptance
claimed. Reviewed concrete endpoint ordering and both PostgreSQL stores.
MarkConsumedAndRecordAsync does not compare-and-set consumed=false and does not share a
transaction across quote and ledger updates. It records an ExecutedAt timestamp before
later inference; the row alone is not proof that inference completed.
end footer

@enduml
